{"categories":[],"data_as_of":"2026-11-08T03:11:48Z","description":"本站近 30 天收录的 机器学习 相关证据与变化。","evidence":[{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_cd3561f842c0907333a36b94ffc5aa11142644d97c075c4b3bddf3879ff2a85e","internal_url":"/posts/20261107-blogs_podcasts-how-to-predict-the-behavior-of-molecules-from-scan-0-0bb49f9654/","observation_id":"obs_0bb49f96544d94ecd80e77ab083459a74cffd73257f1c75429a36d100ed1f6b6","published_at":"2026-11-06T19:00:00Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"MIT 团队提出分子性质预测模型 CheMeleon：通过预训练学习分子结构与化学描述符之间的关系，再用少量任务数据微调，以预测溶解度、黏度、生物活性等性质。","title":"How to predict the behavior of molecules from scant data"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_88a612f2b9d9e09fe85c32779b74d6a4a0ca737140afc675eb60eac1496e994b","internal_url":"/posts/20261107-arxiv-xstack-a-benchmark-for-ml-repo-migration-0-c506adad28/","observation_id":"obs_c506adad28825d2b4f3de3c5e292070bbd219fb1a6fa5dc04956dc9de5be67a4","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:55:54Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"XStack 是一个用于评估 AI 代理跨框架、跨硬件迁移机器学习代码仓库的基准。代理需要把 PyTorch 仓库迁移为可在 TPU 上运行的 JAX 仓库，并通过基于原仓库结果的校准评分。","title":"XStack: A Benchmark for ML Repo Migration"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_d9826a69ee6bd32f994d304dae3fc4640f1d9d54e6bf7c49de5340934fde7cc0","internal_url":"/posts/20261108-arxiv-reprobridge-building-reproducibility-into-ml-resea-2-5d920b8c07/","observation_id":"obs_5d920b8c0784633371b19f05fcbc35b545ad7b7b847e7f7676f28bda4f20be55","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:45:36Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"ReproBridge 将代码、环境配置、实验启动器和复现指南整合成标准化制品，并通过智能体工作流保存实验过程中的操作知识与决策。其目标是提升机器学习实验的独立复现成功率。","title":"ReproBridge: Building Reproducibility into ML Research Artifacts"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_0d40ab33453c1ffd45f8b8479389ebf75d40c8739f45f4bca22caeb204d73530","internal_url":"/posts/20261106-blogs_podcasts-how-amazon-marketplace-evaluates-content-quality-w-1